friendly and designed for child development. Play-Based Education: We believe in learning through play and imaginative toy reviews and scenarios that teach social skills and problem-solving.\",\"channelTitle\":\"Kids Learn and Grow - Educational Videos\",\"channelId\":\"UCGxE9I3vpwj9973SaW72tqg\",\"publishedAt\":\"2024-09-14T13:26:05Z\",\"duration\":\"8:21\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BihhMsr4CCk/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BihhMsr4CCk/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BihhMsr4CCk/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BihhMsr4CCk/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BihhMsr4CCk/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}}},{\"id\":\"_UNe6tz28OI\",\"title\":\"Best Toy Learning Video for Toddlers and Kids - Learn Colors and Counting in the Garden!\",\"description\":\"Genevieve's Playhouse toys are now available at Target, Walmart, and on Amazon! Find them here:\\n🎯 Target: https://www.target.com/b/genevieve-s-playhouse/-/N-q643lep2c\\n🛒 Walmart: https://www.walmart.com/brand/genevievesplayhouse/genevieves-playhouse/20040888?selectedSellerId=0\\n📦 Amazon: https://www.amazon.com/stores/page/14B18C57-B58B-4B5E-BD3D-35C3BE857431?ingress=2&lp_context_asin=B0G27V1YJT&lp_context_query=genevieve%27s%20playhouse%20toys&visitId=c731c54a-fd61-49aa-adb3-d8a02ab5e369&ref_=ast_bln\\nGenevieve Toys!\\nShop at Walmart now!\\nLink: https://www.walmart.com/brand/genevievesplayhouse/genevieves-playhouse/20040888?selectedSellerId=0\\n\\nBest Toy Learning Video for Toddlers and Kids - Learn Colors and Counting in the Garden! Spring is here, so let's plant seeds in our garden. Kids will have fun learning colors and counting, while our garden begins to grow. Now that spring is here, birds will want to feed their babies worms, and we'll need to collect our garden vegetables. We'll sort our carrots from smallest to largest and even go fishing for colorful fish in the pond. Toddlers will have lots of colorful, family friendly fun with these bright and educational toys.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nYou can buy some of the great toys featured in our videos here:\\nhttps://www.genevievesplayhouse.com/shop-toys\\n\\nSubscribe to Genevieve's Playhouse Here:\\nhttps://www.youtube.com/GenevievesPlayhouse?sub_confirmation=1\",\"channelTitle\":\"Genevieve's Playhouse - Learning Videos for Kids\",\"channelId\":\"UCK5Q72Uyo73uRPk8PmM2A3w\",\"publishedAt\":\"2021-03-23T01:43:53Z\",\"duration\":\"6:10\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_UNe6tz28OI/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_UNe6tz28OI/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_UNe6tz28OI/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_UNe6tz28OI/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_UNe6tz28OI/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}}},{\"id\":\"l2BAM76LTWU\",\"title\":\"Diana Exercises and learns the English Alphabet - Kids Learning Videos\",\"description\":\"Diana exercises with Head, Shoulders, Knees and Toes song and learning the English Alphabet with ABC song for children. Kids Learning Videos and fun children's songs!\\nSubscribe to Kids Diana Show - http://bit.ly/2k7NrSx\\r\\nhttps://www.instagram.com/kidsdianashow/ Facebook https://www.facebook.com/KidsDianaShowOfficial/\",\"channelTitle\":\"✿ Kids Diana Show\",\"channelId\":\"UCk8GzjMOrta8yxDcKfylJYw\",\"publishedAt\":\"2020-04-25T06:42:46Z\",\"duration\":\"8:36\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l2BAM76LTWU/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l2BAM76LTWU/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l2BAM76LTWU/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l2BAM76LTWU/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l2BAM76LTWU/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}}},{\"id\":\"fAoAV6nTrEs\",\"title\":\"Learn Colors For Kids | What Color Is It? | Educational Video For Babies & Toddlers To Learn Colors\",\"description\":\"🖍️ Enjoy a fun and hilarious sing-along song all about colors made just for kids! 🦁 Lucas, Ruby, and their adorable friends join in to explain everything children need to know about colors in a catchy nursery rhyme form. 🎨 Before you know it, your little ones will know all about colors, animals, and more!\\n\\nIn this song kids will learn colors using examples from nature, including animals, birds, fish, and insects. 🍭 Each one shows a fun representation of the color to make it easy for kids to make the mental connection—red apples and ladybugs, yellow ducks and bees, etc. 🌈 It’s a great way to make the colors pop to life, and it will also teach kids, toddlers, and even babies names of common animals! 🤩\\n\\n🖌️ Get ready to dance, play, sing and learn with this colors song for children. Presented by Lucas & Friends in ultra HD 4k for the best in audio-visual quality! ✔️\\n\\n00:00 Lucas & Friends Intro\\n0:12 ❤️ Red - The ladybug and the crab are red.\\n1:35 📙 Orange - The fish and the giraffe are orange. \\n1:51 🟡 Yellow - The duck and the bee are yellow.\\n4:07 🍏 Green - The parrot and the frog are green. \\n5:21 🔷 Blue - The butterfly and the dolphin are blue. \\n6:39 🟪 Purple - The octopus and the umbrella are purple.\\n7:56 🌸 Pink - The pig and the flamingo are pink.\\n9:11 🟤 Brown - The kangaroo and the monkey are brown.\\n10:26 🐀 Gray - The mouse and the elephant are gray.\\n11:45 ⚫ Black - The sheep and the spider are black.\\n12:59 🤍 White - The snowman and the rabbit are white.\\n\\n⭐ If our video entertains your child and makes them happy, please hit the LIKE button. SHARE it with your friends and family members so that more and more kids can sing and have fun. 👍 SUBSCRIBE to our channel to watch our other nursery rhymes, kids songs, and educational videos for children and parents. 🔔 And make sure you turn on the bell icon to get notified as soon as our new videos come up. 🔥\\n\\n🛍️ Official Lucas & Friends Store Now Open - https://shop.rvappstudios.com\\n\\n📢 Checkout Lucas & Friends Educational Children's Books: https://www.amazon.com/Lucas-Friends-by-RV-AppStudios/e/B0BBM1LZF3  \\n\\n🎯 Try our FREE Educational Apps for Babies & Toddlers:\\n      🟡 Google Play: https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=7430005971129979939\\n      🟣 iOS: https://apps.apple.com/developer/rv-appstudios-llc/id340181308\\n      🟢 RV AppStudios: https://www.rvappstudios.com/kidsapp.html\\n\\n🌟 More fun nursery rhymes and kids songs by RV AppStudios:\\n\\n✏️ Learn Colors With Lucas and Ruby - https://youtu.be/qMkXnwRlpRo\\n🔅 Colors For Kids Song - https://youtu.be/Mc5S5P_yQ0A\\n🎵 Color Song for Kids - https://youtu.be/PoMPLwKgeKw\\n🟨 Learn Shapes for Kids - https://youtu.be/SOBCQ7pJjiA\\n\\nCopyright © RV AppStudios\\n\\n#LearnColors #EducationalVideos #colorsforkids\",\"channelTitle\":\"Toddler Learning Videos For Kids - Lucas & Friends\",\"channelId\":\"UCYqksDldZTkKmsrBb4OGJ9g\",\"publishedAt\":\"2023-01-06T12:00:22Z\",\"duration\":\"14:54\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fAoAV6nTrEs/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fAoAV6nTrEs/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fAoAV6nTrEs/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fAoAV6nTrEs/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fAoAV6nTrEs/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}}},{\"id\":\"JPSNzfRlkPk\",\"title\":\"Learn Wild Animals for Kids | Wild Animals Names | Fun 3D Toddlers Learning Video\",\"description\":\"Go on a fun wild animal adventure for kids! 🦁🐘🦒 Join the cute Bunny and Ostrich as they explore the wild and learn the names of amazing animals through colorful 3D cartoon animation.\\n\\nIn this fun educational video, children can learn about:\\n\\n🦁 Lion\\n🐘 Elephant\\n🦒 Giraffe\\n🦓 Zebra\\n🐆 Leopard\\n🐊 Crocodile\\n🐦 Ostrich\\n\\nThis wild animals learning video is designed for toddlers, preschoolers, kindergarten children, and early learners. Bright colors, cute characters, simple visuals, and playful animation help make learning animal names enjoyable and engaging.\\n\\n🌟 Perfect for:\\n\\nWild animals names for kids\\nAnimal learning for toddlers\\nPreschool learning\\nKindergarten education\\nEnglish vocabulary for kids\\nAnimal names in English\\n3D educational cartoons\\nKids learning videos\\nEarly childhood learning\\n\\nSubscribe to Schoolify for more fun learning videos about animals, fruits, vegetables, ABC, counting, colors, and more! 🌈📚\\n\\n#WildAnimals #AnimalsForKids #KidsLearning\",\"channelTitle\":\"Schoolify - Kids World\",\"channelId\":\"UCnHY39KlRohEXmqyGRMWUow\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-09-25T04:00:12Z\",\"duration\":\"11:57\",\"thumbnails\":{\"default\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JPSNzfRlkPk/default.jpg\",\"width\":120,\"height\":90},\"medium\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JPSNzfRlkPk/mqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":320,\"height\":180},\"high\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JPSNzfRlkPk/hqdefault.jpg\",\"width\":480,\"height\":360},\"standard\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JPSNzfRlkPk/sddefault.jpg\",\"width\":640,\"height\":480},\"maxres\":{\"url\":\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JPSNzfRlkPk/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":720}}}],\"query\":\"kids educational videos\"}"}